Package: Rtrino
Title: DBI Backend for Trino
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Luis A", "Casas Ballestas", email = "luisangelcasasbl@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'DBI' compliant backend for Trino <https://trino.io>, the
    distributed SQL query engine (successor of PrestoSQL). Connects to a Trino
    cluster over its HTTP REST API, executes queries with automatic pagination,
    maps Trino types to R types, and integrates with 'dplyr' through 'dbplyr'
    SQL dialects. Supports basic, JWT bearer and OAuth2 client credentials
    authentication, as well as custom certificate authorities.
